atteries/Tactic/Lint/Basic.lean#L122-L127"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">structure</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Batteries/Tactic/Lint/Basic.html#Batteries.Tactic.Lint.NamedLinter\"><span class=\"name\">Batteries</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">Lint</span>.<span class=\"name\">NamedLinter</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_extends\">extends</span> <span id=\"Batteries.Tactic.Lint.NamedLinter.toLinter\"><a href=\"./Batteries/Tactic/Lint/Basic.html#Batteries.Tactic.Lint.Linter\">Batteries.Tactic.Lint.Linter</a></span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"A `NamedLinter` is a linter associated to a particular declaration.","docLink":"./Batteries/Tactic/Lint/Basic.html#Batteries.Tactic.Lint.NamedLinter","kind":"structure","line":122,"name":"Batteries.Tactic.Lint.NamedLinter","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover-community/batteries/blob/41c46f8a9586f75b6ea12296c05e932cc2707d51/Batteries/Tactic/Lint/Basic.lean#L122-L127"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">abbrev</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Batteries/Tactic/Lint/Basic.html#Batteries.Tactic.Lint.Linter.isLocal\"><span class=\"name\">Batteries</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">Lint</span>.<span class=\"name\">Linter</span>.<span class=\"name\">isLocal</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">self</span> : <a href=\"./Batteries/Tactic/Lint/Basic.html#Batteries.Tactic.Lint.Linter\">Linter</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Bool\">Bool</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Whether this linter's verdict on a declaration depends only on the declaration's own module,\nso that linting just the declarations of changed modules (`runLinter --only-modules`) cannot miss\na report. A linter is not local if anything another module can add or remove changes its verdict:\n`simpNF` and `simpComm` consult the simp set, the instance linters and `docBlame` consult instance\nattributes (deleting a downstream `attribute [instance]` can create a `docBlame` report).\n\nLocality says nothing about changes to the linter itself or to external suppression lists such as\n`nolints.json`: a caller restricting local linters must lint everything when those change.\nDefault `false`, so that a new linter lints everywhere until someone checks it is local.","docLink":"./Batteries/Tactic/Lint/Basic.html#Batteries.Tactic.Lint.Linter.isLocal","kind":"def","line":120,"name":"Batteries.Tactic.Lint.Linter.isLocal","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover-community/batteries/blob/41c46f8a9586f75b6ea12296c05e932cc2707d51/Batteries/Tactic/Lint/Basic.lean#L120-L120"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">abbrev</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Batteries/Tactic/Lint/Basic.html#Batteries.Tactic.Lint.Linter.isFast\"><span class=\"name\">Batteries</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">Lint</span>.<span class=\"name\">Linter</span>.<span class=\"name\">isFast</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">self</span> : <a href=\"./Batteries/Tactic/Lint/Basic.html#Batteries.Tactic.Lint.Linter\">Linter</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Bool\">Bool</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"If `isFast` is false, this test will be omitted from `#lint-`.","docLink":"./Batteries/Tactic/Lint/Basic.html#Batteries.Tactic.Lint.Linter.isFast","kind":"def","line":110,"name":"Batteries.Tactic.Lint.Linter.isFast","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover-community/batteries/blob/41c46f8a9586f75b6ea12296c05e932cc2707d51/Batteries/Tactic/Lint/Basic.lean#L110-L110"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">abbrev</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Batteries/Tactic/Lint/Basic.html#Batteries.Tactic.Lint.Linter.errorsFound\"><span class=\"name\">Batteries</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">Lint</span>.<span class=\"name\">Linter</span>.<span class=\"name\">errorsFound</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">self</span> : <a href=\"./Batteries/Tactic/Lint/Basic.html#Batteries.Tactic.Lint.Linter\">Linter</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Lean/Message.html#Lean.MessageData\">Lean.MessageData</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"`errorsFound` is printed when at least one test is positive","docLink":"./Batteries/Tactic/Lint/Basic.html#Batteries.Tactic.Lint.Linter.errorsFound","kind":"def","line":108,"name":"Batteries.Tactic.Lint.Linter.errorsFound","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover-community/batteries/blob/41c46f8a9586f75b6ea12296c05e932cc2707d51/Batteries/Tactic/Lint/Basic.lean#L108-L108"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">abbrev</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Batteries/Tactic/Lint/Basic.html#Batteries.Tactic.Lint.Linter.noErrorsFound\"><span class=\"name\">Batteries</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">Lint</span>.<span class=\"name\">Linter</span>.<span class=\"name\">noErrorsFound</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">self</span> : <a href=\"./Batteries/Tactic/Lint/Basic.html#Batteries.Tactic.Lint.Linter\">Linter</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Lean/Message.html#Lean.MessageData\">Lean.MessageData</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"`noErrorsFound` is the message printed when all tests are negative","docLink":"./Batteries/Tactic/Lint/Basic.html#Batteries.Tactic.Lint.Linter.noErrorsFound","kind":"def","line":106,"name":"Batteries.Tactic.Lint.Linter.noErrorsFound","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover-community/batteries/blob/41c46f8a9586f75b6ea12296c05e932cc2707d51/Batteries/Tactic/Lint/Basic.lean#L106-L106"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">abbrev</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Batteries/Tactic/Lint/Basic.html#Batteries.Tactic.Lint.Linter.test\"><span class=\"name\">Batteries</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">Lint</span>.<span class=\"name\">Linter</span>.<span class=\"name\">test</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">self</span> : <a href=\"./Batteries/Tactic/Lint/Basic.html#Batteries.Tactic.Lint.Linter\">Linter</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.Name\">Lean.Name</a> → <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Basic.html#Lean.Meta.MetaM\">Lean.MetaM</a> <span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Option\">Option</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Message.html#Lean.MessageData\">Lean.MessageData</a>)</span></span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"`test` defines a test to perform on every declaration. It should never fail. Returning `none`\nsignifies a passing test. Returning `some msg` reports a failing test with error `msg`.","docLink":"./Batteries/Tactic/Lint/Basic.html#Batteries.Tactic.Lint.Linter.test","kind":"def","line":104,"name":"Batteries.Tactic.Lint.Linter.test","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover-community/batteries/blob/41c46f8a9586f75b6ea12296c05e932cc2707d51/Batteries/Tactic/Lint/Basic.lean#L104-L104"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">constructor</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Batteries/Tactic/Lint/Basic.html#Batteries.Tactic.Lint.Linter.mk\"><span class=\"name\">Batteries</sp