div>","info":{"doc":"Returns true if `decl` is an automatically generated declaration.\n\nAlso returns true if `decl` is an internal name or created during macro expansion (after stripping\nprivate mangling; i.e., private names are not necessarily considered autogenerated).","docLink":"./Batteries/Tactic/Lint/Basic.html#Lean.Environment.isAutoDecl","kind":"def","line":35,"name":"Lean.Environment.isAutoDecl","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover-community/batteries/blob/41c46f8a9586f75b6ea12296c05e932cc2707d51/Batteries/Tactic/Lint/Basic.lean#L35-L66"}}],"imports":["Init","Lean.Elab.InfoTree.Main","Lean.ExtraModUses","Lean.Meta.Basic","Lean.Structure"],"instances":[],"name":"Batteries.Tactic.Lint.Basic"}